  "compare_url": "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/compare/main...CubeJerry:research/conserved-phase-gaussian-20261113?expand=1&title=Add+exact-sum+phase-covariant+Gaussian+rounding+with+optimal+bilateral+slack+1%2Fsqrt%282%29&body=%23%23+Summary%0A%0AThis+package+proves+an+explicit+bijection+on+Gaussian+integer+pairs+relative%0Ato+Ali+Romman%27s+%236509+ideal+operator%0A%60C_%2B%28u%2Cv%29%3D%28%28s%2Bi%2Ad%29%2F2%2C%28s-i%2Ad%29%2F2%29%60.+It+preserves+%60s%3Du%2Bv%60+exactly%2C+commutes%0Awith+global+multiplication+by+%60i%60+and+wire+swap%2C+has+combined+Euclidean%0Aerror+at+most+one%2C+and+has+an+inverse+related+by+complex+conjugation.+Its%0Abilateral+pair-radial+supremum+is+exactly+%601%2Fsqrt%282%29%60.%0A%0AThe+upper+bound+is+proved+for+the+constructed+map.+A+fixed-sum+sequence+proves%0Athat+every+exact-sum+integer-output+map+with+error+at+most+one+has+bilateral%0Aradial+supremum+at+least+%601%2Fsqrt%282%29%60%2C+without+requiring+bijectivity.+Thus+the%0Aconstant+is+optimal+under+exact-sum+conservation.+Conjugation-as-inverse%0Apairs+every+radial+jump+with+its+negative%2C+so+the+forward+outward+supremum%0Ais+also+%601%2Fsqrt%282%29%60%2C+optimal+among+exact-sum+error-one+bijections+satisfying%0Athat+inverse+identity.+The+root+audit+proves+this+corollary%3B+no+forward-only%0Alower+bound+is+claimed+without+the+inverse+identity.%0A%0A%23%23+Construction+and+proof%0A%0AFor+%60s%3Du%2Bv%60+and+%60d%3Du-v%60%2C+if+the+two+real-coordinate+parities+of+%60s%60+agree%2C%0Athe+output+difference+is+%60Jd%60.+In+the+mixed-parity+case%2C+set%0A%60p%3DRe%28s%29+mod+2%60%2C+%60t%3D%28H%2F2%29Jd%60%2C+and+use+the+phase-swapped+two-axis+half-grid%0Ainvolution+%60M_p%60.+The+output+difference+is+%60H+M_p%28t%29%60%2C+and+the+pair+is%0Areconstructed+as+%60%28%28s%2Bd%27%29%2F2%2C%28s-d%27%29%2F2%29%60.+The+proof+establishes+integrality%2C%0Abijectivity+fiberwise+at+each+sum%2C+the+inverse%2C+unit-phase+covariance%2C+and%0Aerror+one.+The+score-pair+argument+gives+strict+radial+movement+below%0A%601%2Fsqrt%282%29%60+for+each+changed+pair.+The+fixed-sum+lower-bound+family+makes%0Athe+supremum+sharp.%0A%0A%23%23+Verification%0A%0AThe+original+integer+checker%2C+its+finite+receipt+and+source+notice+are+copied%0Abyte-for-byte+under+%60proof%2F%60.+The+root%27s+separately+written+exact+%60Fraction%60%0Achecker+and+receipt+are+under+%60review%2Froot%2F%60.+%60verify.py%60+compiles+the+two%0Achecker+source+files+from+their+recorded+bytes%2C+cross-checks+6%2C561+integer%0Acube+inputs%2C+60+deterministic+large+inputs+and+20+large+powers+of+two%2C+and%0Achecks+exact+phase-mutant+and+fourth-power+counterexamples.+Normal+and%0Aoptimized+commands+are+listed+in+%60VERIFY.json%60%3B+every+replay+is+read-only.%0A%0A%23%23+Related+work+and+credit%0A%0ACredit+Ali+Romman+for+%236509%27s+exact-sum+Gaussian+pair+operator+and+rounding%0Alineage%3B+credit+Nick+Petalas+for+%236619%27s+outward-slack+optimization+question.%0AThe+%5Bglobal-half+construction%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FCubeJerry%2Finteger-mult-bounds%2Fcommit%2F26226aa52337e6e94bc0cdf3cf6b89d16bb42f5f%29+is+related+work+with+a+different%0Acontract+and+%601%2F2%60+bilateral+slack.+Exact+commit%2C+path%2C+Git+blob+and+SHA-256%0Apins+are+recorded+in+%60SOURCES.json%60+and+%60proof%2FSOURCES.json%60.%0A%0ACubeJerry%27s+universal+%236778+row%2Fcolumn+obstruction+also+applies+to+this+map%3A+global%0Aunit+covariance+follows+from+global+%60i%60+covariance%2C+and+the+map+is+exact+on%0Aevery+integral+image+of+the+%60n%3D1%60+ideal+operator+%60C_%2B%60.+Thus+this+same%0Astateless+map+cannot+commute+across+row+and+column+applications.+This+does%0Anot+rule+out+an+ordered+caller%2C+different+maps%2C+or+an+enlarged+state+or%0Arepresentation.+Its+exact+source+pin+and+the+%60n%3D1%60+witness+are+recorded+in%0A%60SOURCES.json%60+and+the+root+arithmetic+audit.%0A%0AThe+root+supplied+the+candidate+pairing+formula+and+wrote+the+separate%0A%60Fraction%60+checker.+The+proof%2Finteger-check+role+formalized+and+tested+the%0Asame+proposed+map.+This+is+not+blind+review%2C+human+review+or+formal%0Averification.+See+%60ROLE-BOUNDARIES.md%60+for+evidence+roles.%0A%0A%23%23+Limits%0A%0AThis+is+an+unbounded-integer+arithmetic+result.+No+fixed-width+or+tape%0Aimplementation%2C+selected+caller+admission%2C+precision+recurrence%2C+physical%0Acost+bound%2C+or+kappa+change+is+claimed.+Same-map+row%2Fcolumn+commutation+is%0Aexcluded+by+%236778+under+this+map%27s+hypotheses.+The+map+also+fails+a%0Afourth-power+identity+and+therefore+cannot+square+to+wire+swap.+All+five+selected+framework%0Aassumptions+remain.%0A%0A%23%23+Base+and+registered+reproduction%0A%0ACanonical+base%3A+%60e54523517d0f03e58352e647c403a5af3e525a57%60.%0A%0A%60%60%60sh%0Apython3+-B+scripts%2Fresearch_package.py+--package+research%2Fconserved-phase-optimal-gaussian-rounding+--check-only%0Apython3+-B+scripts%2Fresearch_package.py+--package+research%2Fconserved-phase-optimal-gaussian-rounding%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AExpected+markers+include+%60PASS_CONSERVED_PHASE_COVARIANT_CROSS_IMPLEMENTATIONS%60+and+%60PASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE%60.+The+package+contains+the+complete+proof%2C+exact+inverse%2C+source+pins%2C+six+bounded+replay+commands+and+original+frozen+evidence.%0A%0A%2A%2ANo+new+kappa.%2A%2A+The+selected+%60363005817%2F100000000000%60+remains+unchanged.+Prepared+for+%2A%2A%40CubeJerry%2A%2A+with+substantial+OpenAI+ChatGPT%2FCodex+assistance.+Apache-2.0.%0A",
